The Suntiva PRO 1250 is a high-pressure, commercial strength pressure washer. Its powerful 1500 psi can blast your patio, decks, fences, siding, grannies, roofs, pools, decks. The Suntiva PRO 1250 has a 1.75 GPM flow rate and a 12.5 gallons per minute output. If you have a lot of surfaces to cover, the Suntiva PRO 1250 could be a great option for you.The Suntiva PRO 1250 pressure washer is an electric model that operates at 1500 pressure and 500 watts with a cord length of 25 feet (7.6 meters). The PRO 1250 has a 1.75 GPM (gallons per minute) flow rate. The Suntiva PRO 1250 has three different flow options: 50 GPM, 250 GPM and 475 GPM.The Suntiva PRO 1250 is powered by an 800V direct current motor. The nozzle that comes with the Suntiva PRO 1250 is a 3/7.5 inch 1 inch tip. There are two different pressure washer nozzles that come with the Suntiva PRO 1250. The 3.5-inch nozzle is suitable for use with low pressure washers, the 4.25-inch nozzle is suitable for higher pressure washers.The Suntiva PRO 1250 is relatively silent due to its internal sound absorbing materials. The Suntiva PRO 1250's motor housing is made of hard plastic, which can be painted in a color of your choice, for better aesthetics and improved customer satisfaction.The most notable

